{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"screen\":\"那一刻的轻松是真的\",\"source\":\"那一刻的轻松可以是真的，并非假装\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿说轻松“可以是真的”，屏幕稿改成“是真的”，把一种可能性变成了确定判断。\"},{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"screen\":\"又像停在一句没说完的话上 / 像终于鼓起勇气，把心里的话说出来\",\"source\":\"152–167小节歌唱逐渐展开，像终于鼓起勇气说出心里的话。到了168–180小节，歌唱再次展开，情感变得更充实、更迫切。临近180小节，它又像停在一句没说完的话上。\",\"type\":\"7\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿先写鼓起勇气说出心里话，最后才写停在未完句上；屏幕稿将两者倒置，容易读成停顿之后才说出心里话。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"开头的试探又把问题递回来：我究竟要怎样继续生活\",\"source\":\"如果把这次回返听成心理上的回望，开头的试探姿态仿佛把问题重新递回来：“那么，我究竟要怎样继续生活？”\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿用“如果……仿佛”限定为一种条件性的听法，屏幕稿直接断定开头的试探把问题递了回来。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0d502c87-f049-4faf-b3b3-f1dcdd7be782", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T165925260450Z", "elapsed_seconds": 286.657, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T17:04:11.937761+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2f59c64478857d557f8282a908c6a1df1ac9447c8755411ed501a9fa6b7224ca", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\c